WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:01.950
Every small school is also a business.

2
00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:05.082
Yet founders are running it on tools
built for everyone but them.

3
00:00:05.344 --> 00:00:08.373
Enrollment lives in one system, tuition in another,
the books in a third.

4
00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:10.600
By the time the gap shows, it's a deficit.

5
00:00:10.975 --> 00:00:11.725
Meet SchoolStack.

6
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.710
One tool for all of it, with the business
intelligence and AI layer on top.

7
00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:18.953
Every morning, our AI adviser briefs the founder:

8
00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:22.920
enrollment at 84% capacity, and the
recommended priorities for you today.

9
00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:27.130
Our dashboard flags past-due tuition
before it affects cash flow.

10
00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:30.835
And unlike QuickBooks, SchoolStack sees
revenue before it's booked.

11
00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:32.920
Every grade's enrollment funnel against goal,

12
00:00:33.228 --> 00:00:36.280
so an underfilled classroom shows up
before it's too late.

13
00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:38.808
Award a scholarship, and the student's
payment plan recalculates

14
00:00:39.126 --> 00:00:41.998
and flows straight into the cash forecast.
No rekeying.

15
00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:46.390
That's why founders see enrolled seats,
live pipeline, cash position

16
00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:50.140
and a 90-day forecast in one view.
No spreadsheets, no exports.

17
00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:52.850
It all rolls into one- and five-year models:

18
00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:56.100
break-even enrollment, facility cost per student,
operating margin,

19
00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.830
all backed by 23 years of
Building Hope's financial best practices,

20
00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:01.640
translated into plain language.

21
00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:05.640
And our AI coach answers across all of it,
from live data, in seconds.

22
00:01:05.843 --> 00:01:07.925
Plus, it's in the hands of school founders today.

23
00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:12.085
Live two-way sync with QuickBooks,
automated expense rules, and a full audit log.

24
00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:15.440
This is the back office small schools deserve.

25
00:01:16.034 --> 00:01:16.628
Sustainable. Resilient.

26
00:01:17.222 --> 00:01:21.330
SchoolStack, backed by organizations
that believe in education.
